# Optional: your own free NASA API key for reliable live DONKI space-weather data.
# Get one instantly at https://api.nasa.gov  (1000 requests/hour vs DEMO_KEY's ~30).
# Copy this file to ".env", paste your key, and restart the dev server.
# Without it the app uses NASA's shared DEMO_KEY and falls back to the real-flare
# archive when that is rate-limited — the data is real either way.
VITE_NASA_API_KEY=DEMO_KEY
